  "text": "proprium.dominica-xxiii-post-pentecosten-postcommunio",
  "about": "The postcommunio of the formulary “23rd Sunday after Pentecost” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "We beseech You, almighty God, let not human dangers overcome us to whom You grant joyful participation in things divine. Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, forever and ever." },
    "s02": { "translation": "Amen." }
  },
